
.*


!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/**
!.golangci.yml
!.editorconfig
!.dockerignore
!.env.example


docs/*
!docs/adr/

# Go
/innsegl
*.test
cover.out
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Node / dashboard
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Playwright's generated output. The harness writes traces, screenshots and
# videos of every failed run into these; they are large, binary, and a record
# of one machine's run rather than anything the repository asserts.
test-results/
playwright-report/
.playwright/

# Local editor/agent tool configuration. Names absolute paths under the
# operator's home directory and enables binaries that exist only on their
# machine, so it is machine state rather than project state — and this
# repository is public.
opencode.json

# PyPI namespace stub — a defensive registration so the `innsegl` name cannot be
# squatted (threat model A6, AB-09). Published to PyPI, not shipped from this repo.
# Placement is RM-059's (#67) call; ignored until then so it cannot be swept in.
innsegl-stub/

# Property-test failure repros. rapid writes these on a red run; they are
# reproduction scratch, not fixtures, and must never be committed.
**/testdata/rapid/

# Local artifacts
tmp/

# Opencode configuration
.opencode/

# Opencode configuration
.opencode/
*.log
